==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Samurai Doggy]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*10 [[Baa Baa]]s (600%) spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Baa Baa]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns.
**3 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Bring an Anti-Red/Black Crowd Controller such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] or [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] the Samurai Doggies as they are the main threat. If your lineup is designed for them, then you shouldn't have any trouble. Teacher A. has low range and the Bears Be Bare can be stalled using 3 or more meatshields. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] is an option to defeat them.

